{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object visible, approach it. If close, grab it. In order to move it, take it. Finally, inspect object. Or scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject     /> <SubTree ID = InspectObject     /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached     /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible     /> <Action ID = ApproachObject     /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject     /> <SubTree ID = MoveToDestination     /> <Action ID = TakeObject     />",
